docs\WORKFLOW.md:304:- **Implementation and behavior awaiting validation:** Framework implementation, negative-path tests, authorized bootstrap, PostgreSQL validation, independent security review, and deterministic autonomy implementation review remain separately gated. Documentation completion does not prove migration behavior or production readiness.
